# WarriorTeleportBombAggressive (22133, level 78) far from the character: a hit on a member of its
# clan (20003) makes it jump onto the character and want its teleport effect (4671) on itself,
# once (IntAI1 1). Its template here lists no blast, so the 5 s timer the effect arms finds
# nothing to cast; the jump leaves it where it is for good.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorBomb
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorTeleportBombAggressive
npc caller 22133 Monster 2600 0 0 level 78 skill TELEPORT_EFFECT 4671 1 clan bomb_clan 3000
npc member 20003 Monster 2500 0 0 clan bomb_clan 3000
roll caller 0

hit member 10
  S DeleteObject obj=caller
  at caller 0 0 0
  mem caller i_ai1=1
  desires caller cast(caller,4671,move)=1000000
tick x2
  S MagicSkillUse caster=caller target=caller skill=4671-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  at caller 0 0 0
